# ABI 1.13: wide lines (strata_submit_wide_lines) under the sun with its sky.
# - a winding road, 7 pixels wide with round caps, drawn as 16 segments that
#   share their ends, so the joints have no notches;
# - a river 1.5 world units wide that runs from the far hills, under the
#   camera and out behind it: it narrows with distance, and its segment that
#   crosses behind the eye is cut there, not dropped or turned inside out;
# - a ribbon that tapers from 18 to 2 pixels and fades from orange to yellow,
#   with square ends;
# - for comparison, a one-pixel line (strata_submit_lines) beside 2, 4 and 8
#   pixel wide lines;
# - a brown block hides the middle of a depth-tested wide line, while an
#   on_top wide line in magenta shows through it.
size 320 180
camera 0 5 12  0 0.5 -2  60 0.1 100
lighting sun 0.42 35  2 1024 40 0.6 0
clear 0 0 0 1 sky
mesh 0.30 0.50 0.25
vertices -40 0 40  40 0 40  40 0 -40  -40 0 -40
